dist-track/

# Editor / agent scratch. `src/world/Props.ts.bak` was sitting untracked in the
# tree and would have been swept into the next `git add -A` — which is exactly
# the provenance accident this project has already had three times. Ignored
# rather than deleted: excluding a scratch copy is not the same as destroying
# someone's work.
*.bak
*.orig
*.rej

# Local subpath rehearsal for GitHub Pages: `dist` copied to `served/<repo>/`
# and served over static HTTP, which is what catches absolute-path mistakes that
# `vite preview` at the origin root hides. Build output, never committed.
served/
